  "display_title": "The Duchess's Secret Writing Life",
  "description": "As an introvert, Alisha Weber has spent most of her time writing the fantasy series \"The Knight's Return\" under a pseudonym, only to have her freedom threatened when she's pressured to marry. Enter Duke Lhesa Armunt, another introvert with a similar issue and a rabid fan of \"The Knight's Return\"! Upon meeting each other, they realize they're a rather good match and agree to a contract marriage. But how long can Alisha keep her writing life a secret when living with a huge fan of her own work? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
